🚗 Smart Parking System using Arduino and IoT
🎯 Project Objective

To design a smart parking system that automatically detects whether a parking slot is available or occupied using ultrasonic sensors, and displays the real-time parking status on a web dashboard or local display.

The system helps reduce congestion and time wasted searching for parking spots — a great real-world IoT application.

🧠 Core Concepts Involved

Embedded Systems (Arduino + Sensors)

IoT Data Communication (Serial / MQTT / HTTP)

Sensor Interfacing (Ultrasonic or IR Sensors)

Real-time Data Visualization (Python / Node-RED / Web Dashboard)

